cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use kube-q, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "kube-q: chat with your Kubernetes cluster from the terminal"
abstract: >-
  kube-q is an open-source command-line interface and Python SDK for chatting
  with a Kubernetes cluster in plain English from the terminal. It is the client
  for the KubeIntellect AI backend, with streaming responses, local session
  history, full-text search, conversation branching, token cost tracking,
  human-in-the-loop approval, and a Rich terminal UI.
type: software
